{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日 「 命は美しい 」発売です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はType.BにちまとのPV\nそしてType.Cに参加楽曲\n君は僕と会わない方がよかったのかな\nが収録されています☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまとのPVについて\n少し解説させてもらうと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24時間の行動を表現してます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝着替えたり、お勉強したり\nクラブ活動でサッカーしたり、\n夜はアイドルとしてライブしたり！\n(だからマネキンのとこだけ笑顔♡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に見て欲しいのは\n私の将棋とちまの歌舞伎"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このダンスは何を表現してるのかな？と\n考えながら見てみてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして11thキャンペーンで\n東京メトロさんにご協力頂き、\n全駅にポスターを貼らせて頂いています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のポスターは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四ッ谷駅\n四谷三丁目駅\n新宿御苑前駅"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の三駅です(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も今日見てきました！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の後に、高校生くらい？の男の子が\n周りを気にしながら\nポスター撮ってくれてて\nとっても嬉しかったなあ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな様子をこっそり\n反対側のホームから見てました。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何駅か、期間の違う駅もありますが\nほとんどの駅が22日までなので\nメトロの駅を利用する際は\n探してみてください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルの地元凱旋ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"YOKOHAMA Walkerさんに\n私と能條さんとまりかさんで\n取材していただきました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この3人みんな神奈川出身ですが\nこの中で横浜出身は私だけということで、\n私が学生時代に本当にたくさん通ってた\n「ぶる」という\nお店に行ってきました～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の母校の近くにあるお店で\nすごくおいしいんだよ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店の人も私のこと覚えててくれてて\nびっくり('ﾛ'('ﾛ'('ﾛ' )!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3/20発売です！\n是非お求めください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして「ぶる」さんのレジの下に\nサイン書かせていただいたので\n良かったらみなさん\n食べに行ってみてください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜大好き！地元大好きな私が\nめちゃくちゃ所縁のある駅で\nお仕事が出来て本当に幸せです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"YOKOHAMA Walkerさん\nありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クルージングは船酔いしなかった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したよー(っ﹏-)\n私、乗り物酔い結構する人なの(っ﹏-)\n頭がずっと重かった(っ﹏-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"釣り部失格(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！釣り部と言えば\n次回のぎ天釣り部です(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今更になってしまったけど\nBerryz工房さんのラスコンに\n3/3に行ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたなしでは生きてゆけない\nデビューシングル発売日と同じ日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はモー娘。さんを見てアイドルに憧れ、\nハロプロキッズオーディションが\n人生初めてのオーディションでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここから私の長い長い\nオーディション生活が始まるわけですが(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンサートやイベントも\nたくさん行きましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベリーズさん単独だと\n一番最初のZeppでやってた\nリリイベに行ったこと今でも覚えてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく寂しいですが、\n私はいつまでも応援しています♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Berryz工房さんお疲れ様でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/18/8232031/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}